        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA kūlī Baluki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa kanè gwa būsugi bo ng'wa Yehoyakimu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosia ntemi wa Yuda, ū ng'hangi Yelemia wahayaga mihayo, Baluki ng'wana Nelia wīyandīka mu shitabo; hanuma ya henaho ū Yelemia ūng'wīla ū Baluki kwīyandīka ī mihayo īyī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīkūwīla ū bebe Baluki gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūkūdaayaga ūhaya gīkī, ‘Yee Naaluha būlī! Ū SEEBA akūmanagūnongeja būpīna a higūlya ya mayanga gane; nose naaseedeekile kūlwa kwikala nūpīīmīla, ndūhū na wifuulīlo.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Ng'wīlage gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA alīhaya, Pye a hose ū mu sī nakūshigwisha īsho naashizenga, nī shisho nashihamba nakūshidubbūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe mmho ūtaalī ūkwikoobelaga mihayo mitaale dūhū? Oyaga ū kwīkooba ī yenīyo. Nguno nakwenha mayanga kūlwa banhū bose pye, alīhaya SEEBA; alīyo ū bebe nakūkūlang'hana būlī kwene ūko ūkūja, būpīle ū bapanga wako.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
